  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:hallel/yehalelukha">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hallel/yehalelukha/1"/>Your praise, Adonoy our God,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hallel/yehalelukha/2"/>[will be proclaimed by] all Your works,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hallel/yehalelukha/3"/>Your pious ones, the righteous,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hallel/yehalelukha/4"/>who do Your will;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hallel/yehalelukha/5"/>and all Your people, the House of Israel,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hallel/yehalelukha/6"/>will joyfully thank and bless,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hallel/yehalelukha/7"/>praise and glorify and sing,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hallel/yehalelukha/8"/>exalt and revere,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hallel/yehalelukha/9"/>sanctify and proclaim the sovereignty
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hallel/yehalelukha/10"/>of Your Name, our King continuously.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hallel/yehalelukha/11"/>For to You it is good to give thanks,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hallel/yehalelukha/12"/>and to Your Name it is fitting to sing praises,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hallel/yehalelukha/13"/>for from this world to the next,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hallel/yehalelukha/14"/>You are Almighty.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hallel/yehalelukha/15"/>Blessed are You, Adonoy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hallel/yehalelukha/16"/>King, Who is extolled with praises.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
